{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaayvurenda/improve
    @copyright  2026 Oksigenia SL <dev@oksigenia.cc>
    @license    https://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    «Propose an improvement»: the piece of Oksigenia Marandu opens it (data-marandu-proposal), with the name of the screen.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * screen - the title of the page
    * label - what the button says, in Marandu's words

    Example context (json):
    { "screen": "Mostrador", "label": "Proponer una mejora" }
}}
<button type="button" class="ayv-improve" data-marandu-proposal="local_oksigeniaayvurenda" data-screen="{{screen}}">{{> local_oksigeniaayvurenda/icon_message_text}} <span>{{label}}</span></button>
